Attribution for recipes.mjs
===========================

Adapted from prismarine-recipe 1.5.0 (lib/recipe.js, lib/recipe_item.js)
and Mineflayer 4.39.0 (lib/plugins/craft.js, synchronous recipe queries only).
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-recipe
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer

The adaptation accepts build-time registry tables, isolates factory registries,
corrects the result metadata guard and outShape delta, and has no host imports.
Other source quirks and missing recipe data are identified in recipes.mjs.
No Minecraft source has been copied.

prismarine-recipe's installed npm package declares MIT but supplies no LICENSE
file or separate copyright notice. Its exact package declarations follow;
no copyright holder or year is invented. Mineflayer's license follows verbatim.

----- prismarine-recipe/package.json -----

{
  "name": "prismarine-recipe",
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "description": "Represent minecraft recipes",
  "main": "index.js",
  "typings": "index.d.ts",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "mocha test/ && npm run lint",
    "lint": "standard",
    "fix": "standard --fix"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+ssh://git@github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-recipe.git"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "prismarine-registry": "^1.4.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "mocha": "^10.2.0",
    "standard": "^17.0.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "minecraft",
    "recipe"
  ],
  "author": "Romain Beaumont <romain.rom1@gmail.com>",
  "license": "MIT",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-recipe/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-recipe#readme"
}

